---
source: tests/snapshots_help_contracts.rs
expression: "help(&scratch, None, &[\"--help\", \"hierarchy\"])"
---
Hierarchy commands for all roles:

  get            Read the native parent/child hierarchy for one work item
  set            Set the native parent for one work item (orchestrator-only)
  unset          Remove the native parent from one work item (orchestrator-only)

Use 'phasegent --help hierarchy <command>' for options.
